the office, parallel to the front door, here the workers co-work. each worker draws a sprite onto a page, sheared by isometric algorith, to draw itself into the metaphorical corporation. every entity has a distinct @nomac or @kreweofvaporwave email. the entities communicate VIA EMAIL. like bash they send text around, but its as markdown or whatever gmail api can handle. we have google workspace access to spawn accounts, groups, etc. rules, we keep all the mail. WORM. agents get paid (in wavebucks) and retire (cash out their savings). The unit of action is a work order. Agents start by performing their actions by hand, but later use bash utilities to make the work more efficient. the reverse bidding system in commissio is the key. agents are paid for action in wavebucks, but they also pay wavebucks to call claude. the agent that wins the reverse bid reckons that it can do the same job for fewer api calls. these are smart contracts, essentially mathematical functions (or bash tests). agents have no privacy, but they have manners: they always go through the front door. agents always coordinate via mail, including sending messages. this means sandboxing a mailserver on dexter.
